        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" value="Why re-execute instead of setattr?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;config.py derives values from each other:&lt;br&gt;  tool_folder = &quot;STM32Cube&quot;&lt;br&gt;  TEMP_OUTPUT_FILE = f&quot;output/{tool_folder}/temp.txt&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;__setitem__ substitutes the user value at the moment&lt;br&gt;tool_folder is assigned, so every derived entry is&lt;br&gt;recomputed instead of going stale." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="450" y="620" width="370" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2b" value="_no_directory_creation(enabled) - context manager that no-ops Path.mkdir and os.makedirs, so a preview evaluation while the user types cannot create folders on disk." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="450" y="810" width="370" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
